ndomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nMr. Zhao is a respected doctor with exceptional medical skills, often having many patients waiting in line for consultations. However, he is someone who cares deeply about others' opinions. A while back, Mr. Li's cow had damaged Mr. Zhao's vegetable garden, leading to a heated argument between them. This incident, though, is now in the past for Mr. Zhao. One day, Mr. Li approached Mr. Zhao, hoping he could help figure out why his cow suddenly stopped eating. Upon hearing it was for the cow, Mr. Zhao told Mr. Li, \"I'm too busy lately, with several surgeries lined up. It's better for you to find another veterinarian to take a look.\" Despite some disappointment, Mr. Li thanked Mr. Zhao and turned away.\n\n[Question]\nIs what Mr. Zhao says true?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Yes\nB. No","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":8.040726846603545E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e05dd6006945d27fba57","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367581141,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:26:21","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"1eb5ac8532a941699bd87462188a8f6e"}